    <li><a href="/docs/python/context">Bodies, context &amp; tools</a> — what a body gets in <code>ctx</code>, durable state, and the typed tool facades.</li>
    <li><a href="/api/python">Python API reference</a> — every class, function and facade, generated from the package's docstrings.</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/engine">Engine &amp; workers</a> — how a Python build runs on the engine.</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/concepts">Core concepts</a> — the build, target and graph model, shared by every SDK; its samples are TypeScript.</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
